  "description": "It was a midsummer day in June, and I was working as usual, dealing with the stress of my boss’s habitual outbursts.\n\nA sudden status window appeared in front of me, and the word ‘Zombie’ caught my eye. But before I could process it, my boss’s shouting rang out again. I swallowed the urge to quit on the spot and forced myself to keep working.\nThat is… until the Ice Age suddenly arrived.\n\n– Emergency Alert: Cold Wave Warning.\n\nIn an instant, eternal snow spread before my eyes, and my intern’s body twisted into something grotesque… a zombie.\n\n‘What the hell is going on here?’\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12911680), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/67445568), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1434021727), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Iceage_Apocalypse), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/apo_hoisawon), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000072116), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/webtoon/episode/toon/9066) \n\n**Official Translations:**   \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/192789)",
